## ChessBase vs ChessKG

| Dimension          | ChessBase                        | ChessKG                              |
|--------------------|----------------------------------|--------------------------------------|
| Data model         | Flat proprietary format          | RDF/OWL ontology                     |
| Querying           | Keyword/filter search            | SPARQL semantic queries              |
| Reasoning          | None                             | OWL/SHACL (inferred facts)           |
| Link prediction    | Not supported                    | KG Embeddings (TransE/RotatE)        |
| Interoperability   | Closed ecosystem                 | Open RDF standard                    |

